                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b340ae9d-4f74-35c8-b9c3-8e196c8b056d",
                        "entry_id": "122103f8-824e-32d9-a439-a6a80b8aafad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rollup, rollie (hand-rolled cigarette)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e4c20b7-cd96-4620-a407-9e5a344fb883",
                                "sense_id": "b340ae9d-4f74-35c8-b9c3-8e196c8b056d",
                                "text": "Во второй вечер профессор, осунувшийся и побледневший без пищи, взвинчивая себя лишь толстыми самокрутками, изучал новое поколение амёб, а в третий день он перешёл к первоисточнику, т. е. к красному лучу.",
                                "translation": "On the second evening the Professor, pale and haggard, his only sustenance the thick cigarettes he rolled himself, studied the new generation of amoebas. And on the third day he turned to the primary source, i.e., the red ray.",
                                "english": "On the second evening the Professor, pale and haggard, his only sustenance the thick cigarettes he rolled himself, studied the new generation of amoebas. And on the third day he turned to the primary source, i.e., the red ray."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
